    "html": "<p>Three lamps (X, Y and Z) are connected as shown in the circuit. The emf of the cell is 20 V. The internal resistance of the cell is negligible. The power dissipated by X, Y and Z is 10 W, 20 W and 20 W respectively.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the voltage across Lamp X and Lamp Y?</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td><p>Lamp X</p></td><td><p>Lamp Y</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"A\"><td><p>A.</p></td><td><p>16 V</p></td><td><p>4 V</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td><p>B.</p></td><td><p>4 V</p></td><td><p>16 V</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td><p>C.</p></td><td><p>4 V</p></td><td><p>8 V</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td><p>D.</p></td><td><p>16 V</p></td><td><p>16 V</p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>[1]</p>"
